.TH MYSTRNCPY 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy at most n characters of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrncpy(char *" dest ", const char *" src ", int " n ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copies at most
.I n
characters from
.I src
into
.I dest.
If
.I src
is shorter than
.I n,
the remainder of
.I dest
is padded with null bytes; otherwise
.I dest
is not null-terminated.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters copied from src.
.SH AUTHOR
Your Name <your.email@example.com>
